{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 45","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of diagonals that can be drawn in a polygon of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> sides is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb39bb6be21ddf72d09b96637b30038e5cd6b806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4850 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4950\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9900 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 98 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-gon has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f719772748c0c068cf03eed55e7346aa36ef41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{100}{2}=4950$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"115\" height=\"53\" /> distinct pairs of vertices. Of these pairs, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> determine sides of the polygon.  All other pairs determine diagonals, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-gon has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4c8aa14e2233407de75d808782b30041018df52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4950-100=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4850 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"193\" height=\"28\" /> diagonals.\n</p><p>~Mayuresh Nayak (@Son_of_Newton), edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the first endpoint of the diagonal, any of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> vertices of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-gon may be chosen.  For the second endpoint, any vertex that is neither the same as nor adjacent to the first endpoint may be chosen, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c8c9bd978b57a64969b6a8859a1b3a95b6e762a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 - 3 = 97$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"101\" height=\"13\" /> choices.  However, this counts each diagonal twice as the order in which the endpoints are selected is irrelevant.  Therefore, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-gon has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c87531802a8088fca3ec501ffcf7ce1e9a5ccb49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100 \\cdot 97}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4850}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" /> diagonals.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is well-known that an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />-gon has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b4c21f0e5818daeb4d9b3ac0c7e76ccf9056b86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n-3)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" /> diagonals. Therefore, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-gon has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/228ab562accf5845570eab033d772e9b542dc2cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100\\cdot 97}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4850 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" /> diagonals.\n</p><p>-<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cxsmi\">cxsmi</a>, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">Problem 44</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">Problem 46</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1950 A